> [root@localhost alsa-lib-1.0.12]# CC=armv5l-linux-gcc ./configure --build=i386-linux
> --prefix=/board-rfs --host=armv5l-linux --target=armv5l-linux --enable-shared=yes
> --enable-static=no --disable-hwdep --disable-instr --with-headers=/board-rfs/usr/
> include/

Is /board-rfs the correct path?  If you pass --prefix=/board-rfs, this
patch will be built into the binary, so the alsa-lib eventually
searchs for config files under /board-rfs/share/alsa/ and its sub
directories.


